p('The healthcare CSV has 15 disease entities, aliases and six relations: category, symptoms, causes, treatment, specialist and prevention. CSV rows are loaded into an entity-to-relations dictionary. This demonstrates structured querying without requiring a database server.')
p('Healthcare values are educational sample data without per-row medical provenance. Responses explicitly identify them as sample KB entries. They must not be used for diagnosis or treatment advice.')
